# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Cortello's Riddle (626); Mudsprocket's three Wyrmbog quests (98205, 98215, 98231, level 44, #3656), taken at
# Drazzit and Gizzix on the way into the Dragonmurk from the Musty Scroll and handed back before the ride north: the
# Searing whelps and Firemane dragonkin are the ones Brackenwall's quests send you to.
# Swamp of Sorrows (fix round, 2026-11-20): the second swamp stay (Misty Reed Post's murlocs, Fresh Meat, Stonard) and
# the Undercity (Zinge's errands, Lines of Communication, the Undercity's classes' training) are on 40-50/02, right after
# Stranglethorn's errands: Booty Bay -> Grom'gol -> fly Stonard -> the swamp -> fly the Undercity -> zeppelin to
# Orgrimmar. This guide no longer takes two zeppelins, a flight and a hearth for one swamp loop.
# Feralas in two visits (fix round, 2026-11-20): this guide's Feralas part is the Camp Mojache stop (Uzer'i's Muisek
# vessel for the Hinterlands, Natural Materials taken for later); the loop it used to walk at 48 (sprites, hippogryphs,
# Zorbin's first round, the Rage Scar yetis) is on 40-50/06's Feralas loop at about 51, over the same three areas, with
# Vengeance on the Northspring (3063, taken there now) and Zorbin's second round. Screecher Spirits' screechers are on
# 40-50/02's west sweep. The guide ends at Brackenwall Village; the Tanaris guide flies from there to Gadgetzan.
# Orgrimmar first: the flight from Shadowprey after Shen'dralas lands there, so the Feralas guide's Orgrimmar hand-ins
# (Neeru, Zilzibin, Belgrom, Uthel'nay) and training come on this stop; 40-50/02 rides from Camp Mojache straight into
# Shen'dralas instead of flying to Orgrimmar and back out to Shadowprey.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Orgrimmar
  skipto brackenwall when !onquest 625,1261,2976,3002,3121,7732
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From the flight master: the Cleft of Shadow, then the Drag, then the Valley of Honor.
  turnin 3121                           -- Neeru Fireblade, Cleft of Shadow
  accept 3122
  turnin 7732                           -- Zilzibin Drumlore, the Drag
  accept 649                            -- Dran Droffers, the Drag
  turnin 649                            -- Malton Droffers
  accept 650                            -- for the Hinterlands, around level 49
  turnin 2976                           -- Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  when onquest 3002
  turnin 3002                           -- Uthel'nay, Valley of Spirits

step Fly to Thunder Bluff
  skipto brackenwall when !onquest 625,1261,2976,3002,3121,7732
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Your trainer is in Thunder Bluff, on the way to Camp Mojache.
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Thunder Bluff"

step Thunder Bluff
  skipto brackenwall when !onquest 625,1261,2976,3002,3121,7732
  only Druid,Paladin
  zone Thunder Bluff
  train class

step Fly to Camp Mojache
  only Druid,Paladin
  when onquest 3122
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  zone Feralas

step Fly to Camp Mojache
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  when onquest 3122
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly to Camp Mojache (or hearth there, if your hearthstone is ready: it is still bound there from the Feralas & Tanaris guide).
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Camp Mojache"
  zone Feralas

step Camp Mojache
  when onquest 3122
  zone Feralas
  turnin 3122                           -- Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  accept 3123                           -- for the Hinterlands owlbeasts, around level 49
  accept 3128

step Fly to Brackenwall Village
  skipto brackenwall when !onquest 625,1261,2976,3002,3121,7732
  when !zone "Feralas"
  tip No Muisek vessel to bring Uzer'i (you didn't take the Feralas & Tanaris guide's chain): fly from here straight to Brackenwall Village.
  fly "Brackenwall Village"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh

step Fly to Brackenwall Village
  skipto brackenwall when !onquest 625,1261,2976,3002,3121,7732
  when zone "Feralas"
  zone Feralas
  goto 75.4,44.3 "Camp Mojache flight master"
  fly "Brackenwall Village"
  zone Dustwallow Marsh

step Brackenwall Village
  label brackenwall
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Overlord Mok'Morokk, Tharg and Draz'Zilb (below ground) are in the village; their quests are for the Wyrmbog on this trip.
  accept 1166                         -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  accept 1168                         -- Tharg
  accept 1169                         -- Draz'Zilb, below ground

step Dustwallow Marsh
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  when onquest 625
  goto 31.1,66.1 "The Musty Scroll"

step The Musty Scroll
  when onquest 625
  tip Ride south-west to the Musty Scroll.
  turnin 625                            -- the Musty Scroll
  accept 626 optional                 -- Inside Bloodfen Burrow

step The Musty Scroll
  when turnedin 625
  when available 626
  tip The Musty Scroll lies to the south-west.
  accept 626 optional                 -- Inside Bloodfen Burrow

step Mudsprocket
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip South-east from the Musty Scroll to Mudsprocket, the goblin camp at the Wyrmbog's western edge: Drazzit Dripvalve and Gizzix Grimegurgle stand together in the camp. Their whelps, scales and Wyrmtail come on the same Wyrmbog loop as Brackenwall's quests.
  accept 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  accept 98215
  accept 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

step The Dragonmurk: kill these as you meet them
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip East through the Wyrmbog: the Firemane scouts and ash tails roam its northern edge with the Searing hatchlings and whelps; the scalebanes guard the dragon caves further south-east. Mok'Morokk's snuff, grog and strongbox lie in the dragonkin camps. The Wyrmtail grows in the bog just east of Mudsprocket.
  kill 4331 quest 1168.2
  kill 4328 quest 1168.3
  kill 4329 quest 1168.1              -- Firemane Scout walks around The Dragonmurk: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 5836 quest 1166.3 @36.6,69.6 -- Below ground
  collect 5840 quest 1169.1
  collect 5841 quest 1169.2
  collect 5835 quest 1166.2 @38.7,65.6
  collect 5834 quest 1166.1 @44.5,66.0
  collect 280092 quest 98231 @46.2,80.2 -- Wyrmtail
  kill 4323 quest 98205               -- Searing Hatchling
  kill 4324 quest 98205               -- Searing Whelp
  collect 279934 quest 98215          -- Shed Dark Dragonscale

step Mudsprocket
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Back to Mudsprocket before you ride north.
  turnin 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  turnin 98215
  turnin 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

