step Onyxia's eggs
  tip The Eggs of Onyxia lie in the dragon caves in the Wyrmbog's south-east, guarded by the scalebanes; smash five.
  interact 20359 quest 1172.1

step Muckshell crabs
  when onquest 1261
  tip On the way back north from the dragon caves, the Muckshell Razorclaws and Pincers (41-44) crowd the shallows just north of the caves; about one in twenty carries the Jeweled Pendant Marg Speaks asks for.
  collect 5942 quest 1261.1 @54.2,64.0 map 1445 -- Jeweled Pendant

step Level 45.37
  when !group 1173
  when level<45.37
  tip Overlord Mok'Morokk's challenge, back in Brackenwall, needs a group of three. Alone, grind the Firemane scouts here on the Wyrmbog's northern edge to level 45.37 before you ride back north, so you don't come back down for it. Or, with a group, run the Zul'Farrak dungeon instead.
  goto 37.5,68.3 map 1445 "Firemane Scout"
  level 45.37 grind 4329               -- grind on Firemane Scout

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Ride back north to Brackenwall.
  turnin 1172                           -- Draz'Zilb, below ground
  turnin 1261                           -- Nazeer Bloodpike: the Jeweled Pendant
  accept 1262                           -- for Zor Lonetree in Orgrimmar, on the Azshara guide's Orgrimmar stop
  note Keep Natural Materials and Improved Quality: Feralas' sprites, hippogryphs, Zorbin's coast and the Rage Scar yetis come on your Feralas loop at about 51, with the Muisek chain.

step Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk
  when group 1173
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk needs a group of 3. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Overlord Mok'Morokk is elite: grouping up is advised. Beat him down until he gives up, then report to Draz'Zilb.
  accept 1173                           -- Overlord Mok'Morokk
  complete 1173
  turnin 1173                           -- Draz'Zilb, below ground